Hi,
OFED-4.8-rc4 is available at:
https://openfabrics.org/downloads/OFED/ofed-4.8/OFED-4.8-rc4.tgz


To get BUILD_ID run ofed_info

Please report any issues in bugzilla
http://bugs.openfabrics.org/bugzilla/ for OFED 4.8

Release notes:
https://openfabrics.org/downloads/OFED/release_notes/OFED_4.8-rc4_release_notes

OFED-4.8-rc4 Main Changes from OFED 4.8-rc3
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. compat-rdma:
- Revert "iwpmd: Enable the port mapper service for iWarp providers."

2. Updated packages:
- infiniband-diags-2.0.0
- Removed libibmad (deprecated)

3. install.pl
- disable QIB driver on kernel 4.8
- Disable inband support for mstflint


Regards,
Vladimir

